 <151988757+SnowGlow-aww@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 07:50:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] fix(search): let finale fixed cards take any leader

A finale request with fixed cards and no leader or fixed character put the
first fixed card in the leader slot. On other events fixed cards only have
to be in the deck, and the deck-recommend UI describes them that way, so a
finale pin could return a much weaker deck than the best one containing it.

- Solve such requests once per candidate leader character through the
  existing forced-leader path and merge the Top-K by card set, as the
  unconstrained finale search does. With five fixed cards the leader is one
  of them.
- Try leaders in finale leader-key order and give each run the merged K-th
  score minus one as a DFS score floor, so weak leaders are pruned early.
  The floor defaults to 0, which leaves every other search unchanged.
- Share one deadline across the leader runs.
- The brute-force oracle lets any leader lead fixed-card-only decks; add
  four- and five-fixed-card shapes.

Requests with a leader or fixed characters keep their slot-0 leader rule.
